  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "On the first floor you will find comfort in the living room with an adjacent porch, dining area that will seat 10 including the barstools, a fully equiped kitchen, laundry facility, one bedroom with queen bed and one full bathroom. From this floor you will exit the back door and you are just steps away from the neighborhood pool with lots of decking and a covered area for picnicking. The second floor is where the master bedroom and ensuite bathroom with private 2nd floor porch is located. Also you will find another full bathroom located adjacent to 2 other bedrooms with double bed in one and twin/full bunk beds in the other. Go up the next flight of stairs to the 3rd floor tower room where you or the children can relax and enjoy 2 large comfy chairs and a wet bar including a small refrigerator. All bedrooms and tower room are equiped with flatscreen televisions. This cottage is an excellent place to spend your vacation and have access to all local attractions a short walk or drive away with comfort and convenience.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "FAMILY FRIENDLY, GREAT LOCATION!"
        }
      ],
