        "id": "68ed29ed3ac3111c9fb05ab2",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "As stated in other posts, the pictures aren't great, but the actual property is amazing. There is new furniture as well so the \"outdated\" look has been updated. The short walk to the beach beats most other places we have stayed on 30A. One downside is the access at the beach, there is a private beach next to it as well as a chair rental company that dictate where you can set up. Other than that, it was perfect. The pool was a hit for the kids. They went every day for a little refresher. All the restaurants and ice cream within walking distance is amazing too. We would definitely stay here again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
